window.products.push({"id":1167176,"name":"Laguna Luna | Matron of Honor Proposal Box | Will You Be My Matron of Honor? | Empty Mailer Gift Box for Matron of Honor Proposal (Matron of Honor)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813hSNrte5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Congratulations on your engagement! Now that you’re engaged, it’s time to assemble your “I do” crew by popping the question to the ladies who will stand by your side on your big day!   Do you want a memorable way to ask your matron of honor to be a part of your big day? Invite your right hand woman to be a part of your bride tribe with our unique Laguna Luna proposal boxes! Each premium box is made of corrugated cardboard and is the perfect memento to have, to hold, and to cherish.   Each luxury box features a matte blush pink exterior with a glossy white interior with silver foil details that reflect in the light.   Contents: one Matron of Honor proposal box to fill as you please   Dimensions  Length: 9.25\" / 235 mm  Width: 6.25\" / 155 mm  Height: 4\" / 103 mm  Please note that due to the nature of the box, there may be a slight deviation of up to 0.1 inch (2-3 mms) in the dimensions provided above.   Material: 300g CCNB + Eflute corrugated cardboard   It's not just what's on the outside that counts! This box is not only beautiful on the outside, but also permeates quality from within. Thicker than your standard mailer, this gorgeous box is everything you look for in a keepsake! It will not warp or become misshapen when filled with heavier objects, or going through the postal system.* Just like your friendship, this box can weather hard times.   *Please note that if you plan on sending fragile or delicate items, it is recommended that you use proper packing materials to ensure the items reach their destination safely. Please check with your local post office or shipping company to determine what you may or may not send through the mail.   Please note that this box ships flat. To assemble, fold along the guided creases.   Show your matron of honor how much she means to you when you present her with this luxe box filled with your thoughtfully curated gifts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813hSNrte5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Laguna Luna","source_asin":"B07NKVLS28","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1167176","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NKVLS28","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NKVLS28","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1167177,"name":"Lemax Village Collection Winterfest Arts & Crafts Show, with 4.5V Adap #25865","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":72.27,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SZGR16EaL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"At the Winterfest Arts and Crafts Show in Caddington Village, the two stores sell a whole range of handcrafted gifts and for fun, there’s a sleigh in which to have photos taken and the annual Christmas Tree competition. Which of the beautifully decorated trees is your favorite? Once you have selected one, you can enter the crafts store and gift shop to buy the decorations to replicate the look at home. It’s a win-win for everybody!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SZGR16EaL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lemax Village Collection","source_asin":"B0B28GCVVP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1167177","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B28GCVVP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B28GCVVP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
