window.products.push({"id":1167179,"name":"One Holiday Way 18-Inch Rustic Vintage Metal Ornament Shaped Merry Christmas Sign - Country Farmhouse Indoor Outdoor Wall Decoration - Front Door Hang","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hhXes+M1S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Get into the spirit of the season with this 18-inch vintage metal “Merry Christmas” sign. Complete with a distressed, country farmhouse style finish and red and green accents, this traditional ornament-shaped plaque is sure to be a stylish festive addition to any home this Christmas. Use indoors or outdoors as a wall or door hanger, or hang above your mantel and combine with garlands, tea lights or fairy lights to create a warm and welcoming holiday display. Metal. Size: 18”H","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hhXes+M1S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"One Holiday Way","source_asin":"B096MX4MGS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1167179","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096MX4MGS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096MX4MGS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1167180,"name":"Signature Design by Ashley - Huey Vineyard Queen Sleigh Bed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81itqxXoX+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Huey Vineyard bed Enhance your bedrooms dcor with this sophisticated, traditional style sleigh bed. Twin, Full, Queen or King size bed features a curvaceous footboard panel capped with an elegant sleigh rail and a headboard to match. The trendy black finish beautifully captures the richness of the traditional Louis Philippe design to bring a warm and inviting atmosphere to your bedroom.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81itqxXoX+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Signature Design by Ashley","source_asin":"B009EIZUUY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1167180","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009EIZUUY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009EIZUUY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1167181,"name":"\"Winter Berries and Pine\" Artwork by Kurt Shaffer, 24 by 32-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":70.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81NVwTP3DtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features red berries in the snow. Kurt Shaffer has been a self-taught photographer since age 13 (1970). He continues to learn the fine art of photography, especially in this fantastic digital age. Though Kurt does not manipulate his fine art photography, digital enhancement is a valuable tool in his business. He states that if he were to change anything in his work it would be to make it look more like it was when he took the original photo. Kurt's love of the earth feeds his photographic creativity and defines it as his truest form of therapy. When photographing people, capturing the nature in his subjects is Kurt's intent and what he strives to do. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81NVwTP3DtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00JCXERGY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1167181","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00JCXERGY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00JCXERGY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
