window.products.push({"id":1167186,"name":"Sale! U.S. Constitution - High Quality Replica. Professionally Framed (18x 27.5) Genuine Parchment & Quill, Solid Wood Frame","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ZxCHDMQXL._AC_.jpg","description":"A lovely framed American History Memorabilia for someone special, or a perfect present for any age or taste! Each hand-finished genuine parchment is carefully mounted on a sturdy mat board to keep it flat and smooth, and then framed just for you. The solid wood frame comes with a metal sawtooth hanger, clear round bumpers on the back of the frame to protect walls from scratches and dents, and is ready to be hung. The only thing you need is space on the wall. Shop Accent Piece’s large crafted store collection to decorate, accessorize and personalize your home, office, or place of business today. Add something special to a blank wall or any space that needs a lift. Framed prints remain in good condition for years to come. The Constitution of the United States is the oldest instrument of national government in force in the world. The Constitution grants certain powers to the central government, others to the states, and the ultimate power to \"We the People\". Admitting their inability to predict the future, its authors constructed a document whose brevity and lack of detail have permitted it to survive relatively unchanged for over 200 years. It became the law of the land on June 21, 1788. This beautiful 3-D presentation display features an original hand-finished genuine parchment, dense multi-layer picture mounting with custom carved matting design and a writing quill. It is showcased in a double mat, professionally framed in a real wood frame and topped with premium clear framing acrylic.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ZxCHDMQXL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Historical Documents","source_asin":"B000XXDDX0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1167186","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000XXDDX0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000XXDDX0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
