window.products.push({"id":1167251,"name":"American Dryer Global GX1-M Steel Cover Automatic Hand Dryer, 110-120V, 1,500W Power, 50/60Hz, White Epoxy Finish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":142.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61B7eaWLPYL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"The American Dryer Global GX1-M steel cover automatic hand dryer has a one-piece 18 gauge steel cover with white epoxy finish for corrosion resistance; a permanently lubricated, maintenance-free, brushless induction motor for reliable service; and an infrared sensor that turns the dryer on when hands are under the outlet and off when they aren't to reduce the risk of germ transmission by eliminating the need for a manual control. This hand dryer is rated for 110-120 volts and 50/60 hertz for use with single-phase power in North America. Two tamper resistant screws hold the cover to the mounting base to help reduce vandalism damage (security hex key included), and the air intake vents are shielded for additional protection. The motor and the heating element unit each have an automatically resetting thermal protector to help reduce the need for parts replacement in case of damage or failure. The automatic sensor is compliant with the EU Restriction of Hazardous Substances Directive (RoHS) for environmental and human safety. This hand dryer is compliant with standards for use in the United States and Canada by United Laboratories (UL). To comply with Americans with Disabilities Act of 1990 (ADA) Standards for Accessible Design and International Code Council (ICC)/American National Standards Institute (ANSI) A117.1 Accessible and Usable Buildings and Facilities standards, the hand dryer can be installed with a recess installation kit (sold separately). Specifications Motor horsepower1/12 hpMotor speed3,100 RPM (revolutions per minute)Air flow130 CFM (cubic feet per minute)Air velocity4,500 LFM (linear feet per minute)Air temperature130 degrees F at an ambient temperature of 72 degrees FAutomatic shutoff time80 secondsSound level63 dBVoltage rating110-120 voltsAmperage rating12 ampsWattage1,500 wattsCycle50/60 hertzOverall dimensions*9-3/8 x 10-1/8 x 5-5/8 inches (H x W x D) *H is height, the vertical distance from lowest to highest point; W is width, the horizontal distance from left to right; D is depth, the horizontal distance from front to back. Hand dryers have electric motors that blow heated air to dry hands with. They are mounted on a wall, and are hard wired to a dedicated electrical circuit. Hand dryers are typically installed in high traffic or public restrooms to reduce the costs associated with providing high volumes of clean towels and removing used ones. World Dryer manufactures hand dryers, hair dryers, and baby-changing stations. The company, founded in 1948, is headquartered in Berkeley, IL.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61B7eaWLPYL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"American Dryer","source_asin":"B002SAQ7XO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1167251","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002SAQ7XO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002SAQ7XO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1167252,"name":"Bwinmak Fashion Usb Exhaust Fan for Maskes,for Cooking,Training,Running,Cycling,Outdoor Sports (Black Fan,Full Set)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fQ+WmIMpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This fan can quickly discharge the heat exhaled from the mouth and nose, allowing you to breathe more smoothly Replaceable filter design, the product contains 5 filter , easy to replace and use Stronger ability to prevent peculiar smell 【About the fan】After the fan is turned on, three LED blue lights are always on，The fan can be charged，The mini fan is designed with the 15 fan blades, so that it is made to maximize the exhaust in a limited space. It is easy to install, and can be self-modified and installed to any maskes. 【About the battery life】For the USB mini fan, long press 3 seconds to turn the machine on and off, with the 3-gear variable speed. It is charged for the 3~4 hours, and it can be used for up to about 6 hours in the first gear, the 4 hours in the second gear, and the 3 hours in the third gear.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fQ+WmIMpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bwinmak","source_asin":"B093D485MX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1167252","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093D485MX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093D485MX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
