window.products.push({"id":1167254,"name":"Mixpresso Espresso Maker, 15 Bar Espresso Machine With Milk Frother, Fast Heating Automatic Espresso Machine, Steam Wand For Latte and Cappuccino 37 O","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lxsKCoRBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PROFESSIONAL ESPRESSO MACHINE - Our Mixpresso expresso machine is equipped with 15 professional bar pump to ensure quality results every time. A 1450W powerful motor with adjustable controls allows you to modify your personal taste preferences to be a barista and brew your favorite espresso at home. BUILT IN STEAM WAND - The esspresso/coffee machine comes with an adjustable steam wand, with the proper steam pressure to create rich, creamy froth and latte art. you can enjoy a hot cappuccino, macchiato, iced coffee, and latte with creamy and rich foam any time at home. EASY AND FRIENDLY TO USE - With 1450 Watts of power and a double-cup splitter made from heavy-duty materials, this espresso coffee maker is simple to use with one touch ON/OFF” button with red illumination, and coffee amount button, button 1 cup (40ML) 2 cups (80ML) with blue illumination. On the top of the cafe coffee maker, we have a warming preservation stainless steel plate; it can always keep your cups warmer to prevent the coffee flavor from being affected!! PRACTICAL LARGE WATER TANK - A large detachable, easy-to-clean water tank holds 37 fl oz/1.1 L of water. With a removable drip tray, you can easily clean this coffee machine and make your delicious coffees without any mess, and you will be delighted with the price you paid. CUSTOMER SUPPORT - We, At MIXPRESSO, Offer Not Only Top Coffee Espresso Machines Quality Products, But Also Provide Top Of Line Customer Service Along With Our 1-Year No Questions Asked Warranty Policy Which You Won't Get With Other Brands That Sell Expresso Makers For Home!!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lxsKCoRBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mixpresso","source_asin":"B09PG3H6YC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1167254","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PG3H6YC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PG3H6YC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
