window.products.push({"id":1167258,"name":"Pampas Grass Tall 17\", Boho Farmhouse Decor Dried Pampas Grass Decor Bouquet for Wedding Floral Arrangements Home Decorations, Dried Flowers for Vase ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813t+RXQhtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ELEVATE your home decor with our beautiful bouquet arrangement with SIX different types of plants. Whether you display it as a whole bouquet or make it a do-it-yourself project displayed around the home, these are a great addition to your home decor! QUALITY Dried Pampas/Plants: Our dried pampas grass are naturally dried. Each stem bringing you a unique new look every time. Please be aware that not every stem will be exactly the same due to it being naturally dried plants. Dried pampas grass can last for years if you look after it properly and for a minimum of 2 years. WHY CHOOSE DRIED PLANT? Low Maintenance: does not require watering, saves money because it is long-lasting and does not need to be replaced for years to come and gorgeous displayed anywhere in home. Simply put bouquet in vase and enjoy the beautiful display of your pampas! CARE INSTRUCTIONS: When taking out of box, preferably please open outdoors and give each reed a mild shake to allow excess plume shedding. Then put pampas in sunlight for up to 3 hours to get them extra fluffy. Minimize shedding by lightly spraying hairspray. Fluff it up gently if it needs it and re-hairspray it every so often. You can gently use a hairdryer to fluff it up. Shedding is normal and will not change the appearance of the plumes. BEAUTIFUL ARRANGEMENT: Our bouquet comes with a beautiful assortment of: 20 white pampas, 20 natural reed grass, 10 white reed grass, 15 white bunny tails, 3 white sorghum, 5 white ruscus leaf branch, each piece measuring approximately 18inch long although varies as each plume is unique because it is dried natural plants.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813t+RXQhtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Talison Co","source_asin":"B09X6KJJBK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1167258","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09X6KJJBK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09X6KJJBK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
