window.products.push({"id":1167272,"name":"Yoolax Motorized Window Blind Shangri-la Sheer Shade Work with Alexa, Remote Control Wireless Battery Light Filtering Dual Layer Shade for Privacy Cus","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":179.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZNsWgXIRS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FABRIC DETAILS: 100% Polyester fabric. Provide privacy for home but cannot block all sunlight. 60% blackout. Soft fabric vanes suspended between two voile shades, every vanes measured 1.57”W x 2.36”H. Due to the special sheer shade blade, when it closed it still will be 15% open, there will be a little light from the top come through. It can only adjust the blade angle when it goes to the lowest position. SMART MOTORS: Durable high-quality rechargeable battery motor. Type A: R612 Motor need hub(Yoolax Hub need to be bought separately) to connect to All versions Alexa and Google Assistant. Type B: Z425 Smart Motor works with 5 Versions of Alexa(Echo Plus 2nd Gen, Echo Show 2nd Gen, Echo Studio, Echo Show 10, Echo 4th Gen) Other version and Google still need HUB. Two motors are both able to pair to Yoolax Solar Panel. CUSTOMIZE SIZE: Motorized Roller Blinds are all made through Customize. Press the “Customize Now” button to order. Different size cost differently. Outside mount need to add 3” to both Height and Width. For inside mount, the window depth need to at least more than 2.2”, otherwise brackets will not hold the shade stable. If you have special requirements, please send a message via Amazon, we are always at your service. We'll email each customer for customizing information double check-in 24 hours. SHIPMENT & PACKAGE: Dispatched in 4-5 workdays after size confirmed. All mounting kits and instructions are in the package. Remote controls(Optional, we suggest at least have one for initial set up) are all basic programmed before shipment. PDF version and video instruction are available if needed. AFTER SERVICE: Yoolax offers end product a 2-year warranty on motors and controls. Any damage or fails of motors or controls in the first 2 years, we provide repair or replacement free of charge. If receiving damage of fabric or components, please take photos, send claim to us within 30 days. We'll work with you for free replacement in this valid time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZNsWgXIRS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yoolax","source_asin":"B07SC8XG4Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1167272","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SC8XG4Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SC8XG4Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
