window.products.push({"id":1167299,"name":"Electric Heated Blanket Throw, UpBeatPlus 50\" × 60\" Warm Blanket Double-layer Flannel Fast Heating 10 Temperature Setting & 10Hrs Timer Auto-off, 9 Fe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71624dE+G0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FAST HEATING: This electric throw has 10 adjustable heating levels(68°F-122°F), which allows to customize the temperature and comfort suitable for you and help you obtain a comfort feeling in a very short time. Safer and more energy-saving with auto-off timing (1-10H) leave you peace of mind and you don’t have to worry about forgetting to turn off the power in time. SAFETY & RELIABILITY: The heated throw is certified with ETL, and through years of research by the UpBeatPlus brand, it was found that most heating blankets on the market now have the fatal problem that the resistance wire is easily blown after overheating. Therefore, we have developed the V3.0 ProtectCore, which can ensure that the resistance wire will not be blown after the overheating phenomenon occurs and it can still be easily put back into use by re-inserting the switch. COZY & WARM: The full size heated blanket adopts soft double-layer micro-long flannel fabric, which is skin-friendly and greatly facilitates heat penetration and preservation so that wrap you in warmth and comfort during cold moments. The high-quality heating wires are evenly distributed in the heating blanket, and there is a fixed layer to prevent the heating wires from shifting and distribute the heat evenly to keep yourself warm in cold weather all the time. FLEXIBLE & VERSATILE: The 9FT long power cord keeps you warm whether you are resting on the bed, napping on the couch or working in the office, so it is perfect for indoor use with consecutive warmth in chilly weather, in other words, UpBeatPlus will provide you with the warmest and most comfortable feeling in various scenarios. In addition, the controller of this electric heated throw adopts an LCD screen, which delivers more relaxed and at ease. EASY TO CARE: The skin-friendly warm blanket is hand and machine washable by detaching the plug from the controller a, which makes easy to care for prolonged softness and service life. All in all, this is a sweet gift which will bring irreplaceable warmth to your friends and family.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71624dE+G0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UpBeatPlus","source_asin":"B0B6ZM9CK4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1167299","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6ZM9CK4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6ZM9CK4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
