window.products.push({"id":1167371,"name":"KLONVS Storage Bins with Lids, Stackable Storage Bins with Wheels & Folding Plastic Storage Boxes 3 Set, Collapsible Storage Containers for Closet Off","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715scz5qbzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"📦[Premium Quality & Stylish Design] - If you have difficulties organizing your home, Klovns storage bins with lids are the perfect pick. They are manufactured using eco-friendly PP+HIPS+PS, making storage boxes lightweight, durable, sturdy, washable, impact-resistant, and easy to clean. Each storage container features secure lock buckles, keeping the items inside safe and not dropping down 📦[Versatile & Multi-use] - Folding storage boxes can be used for home, office, or outdoor, such as bedroom, bathroom or nursery, living room, closet, shelf, children's toy room, etc. They are good for storing clothes, socks, underwear, scarves, blankets, even books, kids' toys, shoes, etc. These storage containers with lids are a great helper for big household cleaning 📦[Stackable & Moveable] - These collapsible storage bins are stackable, any bin can stand on top of another, so you can stack and design your home style. Also, these stackable storage bins come with four wheels attached at the bottom. This makes them easy to transport, even when there are many items inside. All you have to do is push with your hand and make no noise 📦[Two Creative Double-Opening Ways] - Plastic storage bins with lids open both up top and in front for greater accessibility, and since they have a clear appearance, folding storage boxes allow you to identify and access contents with just a single glance 📦[Economical & Best Service] - Klonvs storage bins with lids can offer enough space to store most daily items so that you needn't to buy other storage boxes. Customer satisfaction is always our goal, so don't hesitate to contact us if you have any concerns or problems with stackable storage bins. Klovns storage containers for organizing bring innovation, fashion, and convenience to you","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715scz5qbzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KLONVS","source_asin":"B0C6T7SB42","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1167371","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6T7SB42","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6T7SB42","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
