window.products.push({"id":1167378,"name":"Season's Need 20” Tall Artificial Agave Plant, Faux Unpotted Agave Succulents for Home Decor, Realistic UV Resistant Fake Agave Plant for Outdoor/Indo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nZ1PdQHcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"COST EFFECTIVE – 1Pc frosted green unpotted agave head approximately measures 20” tall and 20“wide; Investing in artificial agave succulents can be cost-effective in the long run, you won't have to spend money on watering, fertilizing, or replacing plants due to poor growth or seasonal changes. Artificial large succulents provide a budget-friendly option for long-term decoration LIFELIKE APPEARANCE - High-quality artificial agave plants are designed to closely mimic the look and texture of real plants. They are crafted with attention to detail, capturing the unique rosette shape, spiky leaves, and intricate patterns of agave succulents. The realistic appearance of artificial agave succulents allows you to enjoy the beauty of these plants without the worry of maintenance or specific growing conditions. LOW MAINTENANCE – Faux succulents require minimal maintenance compared to their living counterparts. You don't need to water them, provide sunlight, or worry about proper drainage. They will retain their vibrant colors and shape without any effort on your part. This makes them an excellent choice for those with busy schedules or those who may not have a green thumb. DURABLE & LONG LASTING - Unlike real plants, fake plants are highly durable and can withstand various environmental conditions. They are made from quality materials that are resistant to fading, wilting, or damage caused by pests. With proper care, artificial agave succulents can maintain their attractive appearance for years, providing long-lasting beauty in your home or office. ALLERGY FRIENDLY - For individuals with allergies or sensitivities to pollen or plant-related allergens, artificial succulents offer an ideal solution. They don't produce any pollen or release allergens, making them a safe and allergy-friendly choice for adding greenery to your space. You can enjoy the aesthetic appeal of agave succulents without any concerns about allergies VERSATILITY IN PLACEMENT – Plastic plants can be placed in various locations and settings. They can thrive in both indoor and outdoor environments, making them suitable for any room in your home or office. Whether you want to enhance your living room, bedroom, bathroom, or even create a stunning desert-inspired garden, artificial agave succulents provide versatility in placement. DESIGN FLEXIBILITY – Faux unpotted plant agave succulents offer design flexibility as they can be easily incorporated into different arrangements or containers. You can showcase them individually in small pots, create a striking centerpiece with multiple succulents, or even combine them with other artificial plants to create a personalized display. The adaptability of artificial agave succulents allows you to unleash your creativity and design unique arrangements that match your style.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nZ1PdQHcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SN Decor","source_asin":"B0BXT8X6JD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1167378","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXT8X6JD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXT8X6JD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
