window.products.push({"id":1167388,"name":"Awaglass Hand-blown Timer Magnet Hourglass / Magnetic Hourglass","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41K1QfI+dlL._AC_.jpg","description":"It is about time. Who knew that by just replacing the common sand in an hourglass with Magnet Hourglass you could defy the laws of space, time, and physics and make it appear to flow in reverse? But that's exactly what happens with this Awaglass timer. Given their lack of accuracy, and audible alarms, the hourglass doesn't get used much outside of quaint kitchen settings. But as a desk toy, this lovely hand-blown Awaglass makes for a mesmerizing distraction to your tasks at hand. And every time it blooms, you're about 1 minute closer to the work day being over. A Poem for this Magnet Hourglass: When flowers smile in the spring,  we appreciate its beauty,  nostalgia aroma, very few people think that its seeds in the coming autumn what will be. Life is like a flower,  once blooming gorgeous is lucky;  once beautiful bright is happiness. Hourglass Size:16.5*6 cm Base Size:8*8*2 cm","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41K1QfI+dlL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Huntingeek","source_asin":"B00IOX0ELU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1167388","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00IOX0ELU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00IOX0ELU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
