window.products.push({"id":1167634,"name":"Eco-Fused Pot and Pan Protectors - 61 Pieces - 4X Flower-Shaped, 9X Snow-Shaped Pot and Pan Protectors, 48x Round Plate Dividers - Prevent Scratches a","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91NfFmbs-VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FUNCTIONAL POT PROTECTORS ⭆ A perfect solution to secure and store pots, pans and more is this 61-piece non-woven pot protectors. There are 3 types available: flower-shaped 4 sizes (1 pc each size), snow-shaped 3 sizes (3pcs each size) and round-shaped plate dividers. There are 48 pcs of round plate dividers which include 12x dinner plate dividers, 24x dessert or salad plate dividers and 12x saucer dividers. PREVENT SCRATCHES OR BREAKAGE ⭆ This set is a must for storing and separating great quality cookware. These premium liners can be placed in between plates, pots and pans. It prevents non-stick surface scratches, breakage and chipping. Choose from the sizes available to protect your precious chinaware, table and kitchenware. WASHABLE AND REUSABLE ⭆ The material is lightweight, eco-friendly and convenient to use. Handwash and let it air dry to clean and reuse each separator. These are foldable and can also be resized for the perfect fit. These separators are thick enough to provide extra cushion. PROTECTS COOKWARE AND MORE ⭆ Ideal protection for ceramics, plates, bowls, skillets, cookware, kitchenware and even stonewares. Prevent wear and tear and keep your dishes looking new. Use as trivets to set hot pans, pots and bowls on table surfaces. USE FOR CONVENIENT STORAGE ⭆ These are highly recommended to provide ample padding to stacked dishes. Great for storing rarely used glasswares and ideal set to protect kitchenware for transport.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91NfFmbs-VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eco-Fused","source_asin":"B07X4B8V6J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1167634","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07X4B8V6J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07X4B8V6J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1167635,"name":"Brooklyn Steel Co. 10\" Forged Non-Stick Frying Pan – Aqua-Tech Water Based Multilayer Nonstick Skillet Coating, Aluminum Core, Rapid Cool Handle, Suit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81m3mVRE2WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM HIGH QUALITY: The Brooklyn Steel Zodiac PRO non-stick Pan is made with Aqua-Tech - a high-performance Multilayer Water Based Coating. At Brooklyn Steel Co. we are committed to manufacturing cookware that features novel designs with the most reliable cutting-edge technology. ULTIMATE HEAT CONDUCTIVITY: The Zodiac PRO Collection fuses a heavy-duty forged aluminum core construction with durable nonstick coating with a unique interior & exterior speckled finish. Even heating throughout the pan for well-balanced cooking. The stainless-steel induction base makes it suitable for gas, electric, ceramic, halogen & induction stoves. RAPID COOL EASY GRIP HANDLE: This stainless steel induction base frying pan is made with a Rapid Cool handle with metal grip thumb rest for a nonslip grip and stress-free cooking. Handle stays cool to the touch while you cook! This pan is perfectly suited for every kitchen endeavor - preparing family dinners at home or for commercial use. HEALTHY COOKING: Our Non-Stick coating is specially formulated so you can cook with less oil and butter to promote a better lifestyle for you and your family. The nonstick cooking surface ensures effortless and rapid food release for easy cleaning. CLASSIC VALLEY VESSEL SHAPE: Our Zodiac PRO skillet collection features a forged construction, classic valley shape which is both versatile and practical. Shallow body design heats faster and is ideal for the busy chef looking for a nonstick omelette pan, pancake pan or everyday frying pan.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81m3mVRE2WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brooklyn Steel","source_asin":"B09HZ25GMD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1167635","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HZ25GMD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HZ25GMD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
