window.products.push({"id":1167650,"name":"Fragrant Jewels Starry Night Jewel Candle with Surprise Ring Inside (Size 7)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KK54P1mYL._AC_.jpg","description":"If you want to add a touch of magic and romance to your day, look no further than the Starry Night Jewel Candle. Inspired by the dreamy night sky, the Starry Night Jewel Candle combines the clean, invigorating scents of pink grapefruit and orange with the rich aroma of black currant. Drifting just below the surface are hints of sweet pineapple, peach and primrose. A tribute to the night sky, each candle contains a beautiful ring designed with an opalescent stone that echoes the tranquil blues of the sky. As your candle burns, your one-of-a-kind ring will be revealed – along with a chance to win an additional ring worth up to $10,000! From creating an enchanted mood at your next dinner party to enjoying a candlelit bath, this dynamic scent will transport you and your guests to another world.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KK54P1mYL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fragrant Jewels","source_asin":"B07Q1VHQ9F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1167650","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Q1VHQ9F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Q1VHQ9F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
