window.products.push({"id":1167684,"name":"Adortec Electric Deli Meat Slicer Machine for Home Use with 2 Sets of Blades &Food Pushers, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":119.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hQBm9UrBL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"A Versatile, All-purpose Slicer: The Slice machine features a universal, serrated blade for general slicing and a smooth blade specifically designed for ham, sausage, bread and vegetables. With the use of 2 blades and 2 food pushers, you can slice both cooked and raw foods separately, making your food preparation more efficient and safer. Precise & Even Slicing: Comes fully assembled, the electric slicer is super easy to slice from paper thin cut to about 15mm by using a unique stepless large scale dial with each mm numbered on it. Driven by a high-torque eco-motor and a big concentric gear, which could effectively reduce power consumption and increase cutting force, our blade system could achieve even cut with noticeable noise and vibration reduction. Easy to Clean: The blade, food pusher and food carriage are all removable. A quick-release button allows our users to remove the food carriage in seconds without unscrewing the slide bar. Scratch-resistant metallic coating and seamless design make cleaning a breeze. Safe to Use: Our slicer machine is TEL, CE and GS safety approved. The power switch located on the top makes it easy to operate and reach in case of emergency. Four strong non-slip suction feet ensure the slicer stays in place on your counter for safe slicing. Upgraded metal blade lock could fix the blade tightly and avoid any potential risks caused by aging or cracking of plastic blade lock. Light-weight, Compact & Durable: Less than 1 foot deep, the compact design makes the meat slicer easy to move and store. All parts that ensure stability are made of metal, even the blade lock is made of cast aluminum, making it very sturdy and precise.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hQBm9UrBL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Adortec","source_asin":"B0BZPVR962","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1167684","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZPVR962","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZPVR962","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
