window.products.push({"id":1167690,"name":"Fucool® Mini Portable Car Charger Air Humidifier with Essential Oil Diffuser for Car Travel (Purple)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41e7AcymokL._AC_.jpg","description":"Specification:   Material: ABS + PP + Electronic component  Voltage: DC 12V  Working current: 130mA-150mA  Power: 1.5-2W  Water tank capacity: 50ml  Spray amount: 25ml/h  Size: 5.7x5.6x16.4cm  How to Use  1. Counterclockwise turn on the product water tank  2. Pour the amount of water  3. Add the right amount of essential oils if need  4. Clockwise tightening porduct water tank  5. Insert car cigarette port  6. Touch car humidifier touch switch   Attentions   1.This product can be used only when the car engine is stared.  2.Please don't use the humidifier when there is not enough water in the tank.  3.Operating Temperature:0-45 ℃  4.Keep out of reach of children  5.When the product is not being used,Please detach it,pour out all the liquid and store it in a cool,dry place.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41e7AcymokL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fucool","source_asin":"B016UL87XO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1167690","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B016UL87XO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B016UL87XO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
