window.products.push({"id":1167696,"name":"BlizeTec Kitchen Poultry Shears and Seafood Scissors: Multipurpose Heavy Duty with Anti-Slip Handles for Meat, Fish, Chicken, Bone and Much More (Red)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Gj7Ga6C4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE ONLY COMBO KITCHEN SHEARS YOU CAN COUNT ON FOR YOUR COOKING NEEDS! Sleek, ultra durable and elegantly designed by BlizeTec's kitchen tool experts, the set makes a perfect combo tool for everyday chef and kitchen lover. Empowered by our precision cutting technology, BT121PS top of the line multipurpose shears and seafood scissors can handle any kitchen work at ease. Ranging from meat trimming, poultry cutting and to vegetable, herbs and seafood handling. Overall Features & Benefits * Made of quality 2Cr13 stainless steel material.* One hand operated with build in precision cutting technology.* Secure handle with no risk of breaking apart. * Poultry shears have build-in safety lock to prevent scissor from opening after use.* Multipurpose: Can be used on poultry, vegetable, seafood and any kitchen related cutting jobs BlizeTec's Shears Advantages: Cutting Makes Easy Stop buying various types of kitchen scissors. Why not invest in 2 with the price of 1. BlizeTec kitchen shears are built with quality in mind. You can confidently handle any tough cutting jobs in the kitchen. The sharp edge scissor blades can safely cut through just about anything you'll encounter in any food preparation stage. The scissors are comfortable to use and also provide a clean cut feeling during meat trimming and vegetable cutting process. Vice versa, the seafood scissors work like a magic in tackling all seafood related jobs. Don't Wait, Scroll up an CLICK the \"ADD to CART\" button NOW","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Gj7Ga6C4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BlizeTec","source_asin":"B08SF5CHM1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1167696","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SF5CHM1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SF5CHM1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
