window.products.push({"id":1167784,"name":"Tuitessine Mini Donut Food Wax Melts Highly Scented Natural Soy Wax Melts Home Fragrance Set for Table Photo Prop Birthday Anniversary Meditation Stre","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LLrinf83L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FOOD ShAPED WAX MELTS - Indulge yourself in the sweet aroma of these adorable glittering donut wax melts, which feature yellow (lemon-scented), brown (coffee-scented), pink (pomegranate wild berry-scented), and sky blue (vanilla cinnamon-scented). Though they look good enough to eat, please do not consume them! NATURAL SOY WAX MELTS - Made from natural soy wax, these hand-poured wax melts provide a clean burn and long-lasting scent. Wax melts do not need a wick to emit their fragrance which is a safer alternative to traditional candles, and you can enjoy them without the worry of a flame. EASY TO USE – These highly scented wax melts are intended to use with tea lights, electric wax burners, or candle warmers. You can also place them solely anywhere in the house to fill the room with a delightful aroma. Those wax melts are perfect for entryways, bedrooms, living rooms, bathrooms, offices, and more. PERFECT GIFTS - Our natural soy wax melts are packaged in a gift box with a funny donut pun sticker on it, perfect for Easter baskets and stocking stuffers, party supplies, mothers day gifts, Christmas gifts, anniversary gifts, and birthday gifts for women and men. PRODUCT WARRANTY - If you are not satisfied with the product, we will provide a refund or replacement guarantee. Please feel free to contact us if you have any issues or advice.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LLrinf83L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tuitessine","source_asin":"B0BSBJBGFC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1167784","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BSBJBGFC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BSBJBGFC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1167785,"name":"Red and Black Balloons Garland Kit 124 Pack Different Sizes inch Red Black Balloons and Black Red Confetti Balloons for Anniversary Birthday Bachelore","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Jq4NY2QRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎈Red and Black Balloon Garland🎈 The red and black balloon garland kit includes 57 red balloons, 57 black balloons, 10 black red confetti balloons. A roll of 16ft balloon arch strip, 140 dots glue. 🎈High Quality🎈These red and black balloons are made of natural latex, which is safe and non-toxic, can be used safely by children.The latex balloons can support air and helium. Please do not inflate the balloon more than 90% to avoid sudden popping, and pay attention to avoid high temperature, sharp objects and excessive friction. 🎈Easy to assemble🎈 We provide you with 2 tools that assist you to make red and black balloon garland arch more easily. Pull the balloon knots into the ballon strip holes, Glue dots hold the balloon firmly on the balloon strip hole. It is recommended to inflate them with an electric balloon pump, saving you a lot of time to enjoy the party. 🎈How to Make Black Red Confetti Balloons🎈 After inflating the black red confetti balloons, rub the surface of the baloons on carpet or with a dry towel to help the black red confetti stick to the baloon. And it is recommended to use a pump to quickly inflate so that confetti is easer to be stuck. Or spray a little water into the ballon before inflating the balloon. 🎈Suitable for Any Occasion🎈The red and black balloons are very pretty and they are widely used for a variety of theme parties such as weddings, bridal showers, birthday parties, baptismal parties or other celebrations. You can make these red and black balloons with confetti balloons into balloon garland arch, or mix and match with other colors.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Jq4NY2QRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tcwlyfc","source_asin":"B0BCK8SDNW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1167785","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCK8SDNW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCK8SDNW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
