window.products.push({"id":1167812,"name":"Paladone PP5037TAM Tamagotchi Heat Mug | Sensitive Drinks | Colour & Design Hot | Magic Colour Changing Coffee Tea Cup, Ceramic, 300 milliliters","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GbDKtAzSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The legacy: Tamagotchi's were introduced to the world in 1997, and have become a worldwide sensation. Selling over 82 million units by 2017, The hype of the Tamagotchi is still here. Tamagotchi comes from the Japanese words Tomago, meaning “egg”, and the end of “watch.” these Digi pets were a digital phenomenon. New & old: whether you are a new Fan of the Tamagotchi, or remembering the days when you and you friends snuck around playing with them, This cup is a fun reminder of the joy that the Tamagotchi has brought to you. 90'S kids know: the Tamagotchi was ahead of its time. With its creative gameplay and convenient portability, it was a pioneering for handheld games and virtual toys. You weren’t a 90’s Kid if you didn't have a Tamagotchi. Great present: boys and girls of all ages will love this item. An unusual item featuring iconic design and quality artwork makes a thoughtful gift for collectors and enthusiasts. Fun, unique and anything but plain, this mug is sure to be a conversation starter. Heat changing: when heat is added, watch as this mug magically transforms from a blue Mug with 6 Tamagotchi devices into a pink Mug featuring the evolution of a Tamagotchi. This is an amazing present for any 90’s Kid. A fun trip down memory lane.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GbDKtAzSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Paladone","source_asin":"B07MC9K2VQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1167812","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MC9K2VQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MC9K2VQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
